    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11857" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cultello</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, ātum, 1,
				v. a.
			cultellus. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To make in the shape of a knife</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spinam dorsi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					8, 25, 38, § 91</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">32, 2, 5,
				§ 13</span></i> Sillig <i>N.
			cr.</i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To level land by the coulter</i>, <i><span class="en">Front. Limit. p. 43</span></i> Goes.</div>
